<title>UK: Saudi output unchanged at 8.008 mbpd in March - source.</title>
<headline>Saudi output unchanged at 8.008 mbpd in March - source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia pumped an unchanged 8.008 million barrels per day (bpd) of wellhead crude output in March in line with its eight million bpd OPEC quota, a Gulf source said on Monday.</p>
<p>Saudi supply to the market was 8.005 million bpd compared to 8.007 million in February, the source said.</p>
<p>Supply is defined by OPEC as net export sales of crude and products, plus withdrawals of stocks outside national boundaries.</p>
<p>-- Richard Mably, London newsroom +44 17 542 8060</p>
